0..77 Comment "//! `doc-and-deprecated` documents declarations and marks them as deprecated."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..160 Comment "//! Each deprecated use reports its recorded version and note when they exist."
161..201 Comment "//! The declaration itself still checks."
202..205 Comment "//!"
206..281 Comment "//! The checker records each attribute on its declaration. The `deprecated`"
282..360 Comment "//! lint reports every use. The attribute follows `#[deprecated]` of Rust (The"
361..407 Comment "//! Rust Reference, § Diagnostic attributes)."
408..411 Comment "//!"
412..481 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/attributes/ill-typed-deprecation.gandr"
482..529 Comment "//! - see: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/"
